# .gitignore — downstream org-config repo.
#
# This repo holds org-admin-equivalent config and SOPS/age CIPHERTEXT. Only the
# ciphertext under secrets/ is committed; the plaintext age PRIVATE key and any
# local env must NEVER be committed (ADR-0003).

# Environments / local secrets
.env
.env.*
.envrc.local

# age / SOPS PRIVATE keys — the private half lives ONLY in the SOPS_AGE_KEY
# repo Actions secret, never on disk in the repo (ADR-0003). Its PUBLIC half in
# .sops.yaml is fine to commit.
*.age
key.txt
keys.txt
age-key.txt
*.agekey

# Otterdog runtime cache: `otterdog validate`/`plan`/`import` write an async-HTTP
# cache into ./.cache in the working dir. Machine-local, never committed.
/.cache/

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
